      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "45. 分数乘法"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1. 一个长方形长1.2分米，宽0.3分米，求长方形的",
        "面积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出长方形面积，需要把它的长乘以宽：",
        "$1.2\\cdot0.3=0.36$(平方分米)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2. 一个长方形长$\\frac{1}{2}$分米，宽$\\frac{1}{3}$分米，求长方形的",
        "面积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从图148中可以看出，把",
        "1平方分米的正方形的一边分",
        "成二等份，把另一边分成三等",
        "份. 因此在1平方分米中包括",
        "有6个这样的长方形. 就是说，",
        "一个长方形等于1平方分米",
        "的$\\frac{1}{6}$. 所以面积等于$\\frac{1}{6}$平方分",
        "米."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 148",
      "box": [
        770,
        917,
        544,
        555
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-148"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 148",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第二题的内容与第一题相同. 解第一题是用1.2和0.3",
        "相乘. 因此认为第二题的答案$\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)$也是$\\frac{1}{2}$和$\\frac{1}{3}$的积：",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3. 一个长方形长$\\frac{2}{3}$分米，宽$\\frac{4}{5}$分米，求长方形面积."
      ]
    },
